        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1579-626, Locking Slide Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis heavy duty 8\" keyed locking door slide bolt is surface mounted with concealed screws. Supplied with a rim strike and mortise strike for easy installation in almost any application. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nContemporary styled with a fully concealed screw design improves security and appearance. Internal spring tension system that holds the door bolt in any position. For both vertical or horizontal applications. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYou can lock the sliding door bolt in the open or closed position with the keyed lock. Packaged with 2 keys and installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-1579-specifications.gif?v=1704354678\" width=\"600\" height=\"100\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1579-629 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1579-626 Locking Slide Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection (at lock cylinder): 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Width: 7/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1\"</li> \r\n<li>Door Bolt Strikes: Surface mounted Rim and Mortise Strike Plates</li>\r\n<li>Includes new brass #6-3/4\" mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-1579-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262271\"><b>Don-Jo 1579-626 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
